The '''Pacithhip'''<ref name="Complete Locations">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref> were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] with wrinkled [[Color|gray]]<ref name="A New Hope" /> or green skin,<ref name="TPM" /> long trunks, and twin elaborate tusks. They had two [[eye]]s situated on the sides of their head, and the back of their skull was protected by a thick ridge.<ref name="A New Hope" /> A Pacithhip named [[Bok Askol]] was an acquaintance of the [[Toydarian]] [[junk dealer]] [[Watto]] and attended the [[Boonta Eve Classic]] from [[Watto's box|his private box]].<ref name="TPM" /> Another Pacithhip, named [[Ketwol]], was in [[Chalmun's Spaceport Cantina]], [[Mos Eisley]], on the fateful [[Standard day|day]] that [[Luke Skywalker]] first met [[Han Solo]].<ref name="A New Hope" />

